sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Authenticated user
  participant Portal as Personal area (GDPR section)
  participant Me as MeController
  participant Scope as Condominium scope guard
  participant Export as ExportService
  participant Erasure as ErasureService
  participant Repo as UserRepository
  participant Retain as Financial/SAF-T retained records
  participant Audit as Audit / consent history

  rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    note over User,Audit: Data export (portability, Art. 20)
    User->>Portal: Request personal data export
    Portal->>Me: GET export (authenticated subject)
    Me->>Scope: Resolve subject membership scope
    Scope-->>Me: Allowed condominiums
    Me->>Export: createPortableExport(userId, scope)
    Export->>Repo: Load profile + memberships + consents + owned records
    Repo-->>Export: In-scope data (PII decrypted to plaintext)
    Export->>Audit: Record export request (who, when, scope)
    Export-->>Portal: JSON export document
    Portal-->>User: Download portable JSON
  end

  rect rgb(255, 240, 235)
    note over User,Audit: Erasure / anonymization (right to be forgotten, Art. 17)
    User->>Portal: Request erasure (full or partial)
    Portal-->>User: Require explicit confirmation / re-auth
    User->>Portal: Confirm erasure
    Portal->>Me: POST erasure (type = full | partial)
    Me->>Scope: Validate subject/manager scope
    Scope-->>Me: Authorized scope
    Me->>Erasure: anonymizeOrErase(userId, type, scope)
    alt full erasure
      Erasure->>Repo: Remove/anonymize identifiers, sever memberships, block login
    else partial erasure
      Erasure->>Repo: Remove selected non-retained fields (account stays active)
    end
    Erasure->>Retain: Anonymize identifiers on retained records (keep amounts/dates/SAF-T)
    Retain-->>Erasure: Records preserved, identifiers pseudonymized
    Erasure->>Audit: Append erasure request (append-only, accountability)
    Erasure-->>Portal: Erasure outcome
    Portal-->>User: Confirmation (no plaintext PII remains)
  end
